(50500, 959, 1175, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting.  The angle is too extreme.  It looks like you try to add it for dramatic effect but over did it.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting.  The angle is too extreme.  It looks like you try to add it for dramatic effect but over did it.', '2002-04-22 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
