(50508, 959, 1, '<td valign="top">I don''t see a transition here.  Maybe a contrast, as suggested by your title.  But the image alone shows no signs of a cold night... or a transition.</td>', 'I don''t see a transition here.  Maybe a contrast, as suggested by your title.  But the image alone shows no signs of a cold night... or a transition.', '2002-04-23 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
