(50510, 959, 715, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I''m not sure if I would have liked it better if the transition from water to tea would be more visable.  It gets a high note anyhow.</td>', 'Good picture. I''m not sure if I would have liked it better if the transition from water to tea would be more visable.  It gets a high note anyhow.', '2002-04-23 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50511, 959, 357, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to rotate this?  I''m not too sure about the suitablility to the subject, but that seems like a common problem with this challenge, so I''m not going to get too worried about that aspect.  The larger problem is that the composition doesn''t really do much for me at all.  The glass has some interesting textures on it, and I think you might have got more out of it.</td>', 'Did you mean to rotate this?  I''m not too sure about the suitablility to the subject, but that seems like a common problem with this challenge, so I''m not going to get too worried about that aspect.  The larger problem is that the composition doesn''t really do much for me at all.  The glass has some interesting textures on it, and I think you might have got more out of it.', '2002-04-23 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50512, 959, 1290, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t illustrate the title too clearly.</td>', 'Doesn''t illustrate the title too clearly.', '2002-04-24 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50513, 959, 131, '<td valign="top">That lable ruins the picture</td>', 'That lable ruins the picture', '2002-04-24 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50514, 959, 441, '<td valign="top">If portrait ''upright'' and teabag placed in full glass of liquid to show tea stain moving out and flashlit from side to catch transition and composed with more care.... this would have got more points - transition idea ok, just needs more application.</td>', 'If portrait ''upright'' and teabag placed in full glass of liquid to show tea stain moving out and flashlit from side to catch transition and composed with more care.... this would have got more points - transition idea ok, just needs more application.', '2002-04-26 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
