(50516, 959, 245, '<td valign="top">i need more stuff in focus! a longer depth of field could help. the tag needs to be clear. i have a hard time with the raw reflection of the flash on the bottom of the glass.</td>', 'i need more stuff in focus! a longer depth of field could help. the tag needs to be clear. i have a hard time with the raw reflection of the flash on the bottom of the glass.', '2002-04-28 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
