(50678, 989, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice soft color.</td>', 'Nice soft color.', '2002-04-23 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50679, 989, 357, '<td valign="top">This is nearly a good idea.  The tone and subject makes it almost look like a Duch still-life; what it is missing is the hint of corruption or rot (some rot on a petal, or an insect eating it) to get that whole birth-&amp;gt;life-&amp;gt;death thing.</td>', 'This is nearly a good idea.  The tone and subject makes it almost look like a Duch still-life; what it is missing is the hint of corruption or rot (some rot on a petal, or an insect eating it) to get that whole birth-&gt;life-&gt;death thing.', '2002-04-23 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50680, 989, 352, '<td valign="top">The stem is a bit dark, but I love the detail and focus of the bloomed flower!</td>', 'The stem is a bit dark, but I love the detail and focus of the bloomed flower!', '2002-04-23 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50681, 989, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s a wonderful photograph.</td>', 'That''s a wonderful photograph.', '2002-04-23 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50682, 989, 674, '<td valign="top">Nice colurs focus appears slightly blurred</td>', 'Nice colurs focus appears slightly blurred', '2002-04-24 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50683, 989, 714, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed<br/></td>', 'Nicely framed', '2002-04-24 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50684, 989, 918, '<td valign="top">Three elements, blooms, would have worked better.</td>', 'Three elements, blooms, would have worked better.', '2002-04-25 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50685, 989, 570, '<td valign="top">WOW, I NEVER SEEN A PIC LIKE THIS, IT"S AMAZING</td>', 'WOW, I NEVER SEEN A PIC LIKE THIS, IT"S AMAZING', '2002-04-25 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50686, 989, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, maybe a bit too "posed"</td>', 'Nice photo, maybe a bit too "posed"', '2002-04-26 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50687, 989, 527, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.', '2002-04-26 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50688, 989, 346, '<td valign="top">I wish the leaf from the bud had been in the frame as well, since everything else was.</td>', 'I wish the leaf from the bud had been in the frame as well, since everything else was.', '2002-04-27 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50689, 989, 888, '<td valign="top">I really like the colour but it all seems a bit dark around it for my liking.</td>', 'I really like the colour but it all seems a bit dark around it for my liking.', '2002-04-27 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50690, 989, 1070, '<td valign="top">the light brings out the layed petals very nicely.</td>', 'the light brings out the layed petals very nicely.', '2002-04-27 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50691, 989, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot -- good colors and lighting.  A different angle or set up, though would have made it more interesting, maybe.</td>', 'Nice shot -- good colors and lighting.  A different angle or set up, though would have made it more interesting, maybe.', '2002-04-27 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50692, 989, 449, '<td valign="top">cheese</td>', 'cheese', '2002-04-28 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50693, 989, 245, '<td valign="top">did you sharpen this much? the image feels a bit soft.</td>', 'did you sharpen this much? the image feels a bit soft.', '2002-04-28 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50694, 989, 637, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but not a strking transition</td>', 'Nicely done, but not a strking transition', '2002-04-28 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50695, 991, 92, '<td valign="top">Very powerful photo ! A little more depth of field and this would be a 10. It''s up there with me !</td>', 'Very powerful photo ! A little more depth of field and this would be a 10. It''s up there with me !', '2002-04-22 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50696, 991, 536, '<td valign="top">Very well done! Inviting - yet haunting.</td>', 'Very well done! Inviting - yet haunting.', '2002-04-22 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50697, 991, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation, I''m sure you''ll stir up some unkind comments.  Well composed but the lighting needs some work.  Perhaps a white card/ sheet of paper as a reflector to the right and pointing down would have lightened the shadows to the right of the cross ?  You want to keep some of them but lighten them.  Good attempt.</td>', 'interesting interpretation, I''m sure you''ll stir up some unkind comments.  Well composed but the lighting needs some work.  Perhaps a white card/ sheet of paper as a reflector to the right and pointing down would have lightened the shadows to the right of the cross ?  You want to keep some of them but lighten them.  Good attempt.', '2002-04-22 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50698, 991, 714, '<td valign="top">One of the best transitions of all....Jesus'' Resurection.  Nice...very nice. I like the way you set up the shot.</td>', 'One of the best transitions of all....Jesus'' Resurection.  Nice...very nice. I like the way you set up the shot.', '2002-04-22 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50699, 991, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field.</td>', 'Nice depth of field.', '2002-04-22 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50700, 991, 1041, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Good photo.  Black and white works well here.  Would be great if all of the cross was in focus.</td>', 'Neat idea.  Good photo.  Black and white works well here.  Would be great if all of the cross was in focus.', '2002-04-22 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50701, 991, 138, '<td valign="top">um...huh? whats the transition here?</td>', 'um...huh? whats the transition here?', '2002-04-22 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50702, 991, 142, '<td valign="top">I know you will be marked down by others because of your subject.  Too bad because this is a strong representation of transition and is by far the best photo in the competition.  You get a 10 from me.  Great job.</td>', 'I know you will be marked down by others because of your subject.  Too bad because this is a strong representation of transition and is by far the best photo in the competition.  You get a 10 from me.  Great job.', '2002-04-22 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50703, 991, 835, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture but it doesn''t fit with what I was expecting for this challenge.  I understand, and like the idea, behind this picture but I was expecting photographs of things currently in transition.</td>', 'I really like this picture but it doesn''t fit with what I was expecting for this challenge.  I understand, and like the idea, behind this picture but I was expecting photographs of things currently in transition.', '2002-04-22 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50704, 991, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition.  As for transitioning, it''s a far fetched idea.</td>', 'Nice framing and composition.  As for transitioning, it''s a far fetched idea.', '2002-04-22 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50705, 991, 641, '<td valign="top">really good shot. I don''t catch the transition, but I still like it anyway.</td>', 'really good shot. I don''t catch the transition, but I still like it anyway.', '2002-04-22 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50706, 991, 189, '<td valign="top">I think a LARGE cross with Jesus on it and everything would have worked better. You could had even gavin it some crumby title like "Earth to Heaven/Man to God"</td>', 'I think a LARGE cross with Jesus on it and everything would have worked better. You could had even gavin it some crumby title like "Earth to Heaven/Man to God"', '2002-04-22 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50707, 991, 933, '<td valign="top">A very strong photo containing several transitional elements - cross, light to dark, narrow DOF.  The cross could be a little more crisp though.  Nice angle.  Good job.</td>', 'A very strong photo containing several transitional elements - cross, light to dark, narrow DOF.  The cross could be a little more crisp though.  Nice angle.  Good job.', '2002-04-22 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50708, 991, 1175, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Did you put the chain in the infinity symbol on purpose?  If you did thats a nice touch.  Probably should have just opened up the aperture a little to get the whole cross in focus.  Without looking at the title of the photograph this picture doesn''t seem to fit the subject though.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Did you put the chain in the infinity symbol on purpose?  If you did thats a nice touch.  Probably should have just opened up the aperture a little to get the whole cross in focus.  Without looking at the title of the photograph this picture doesn''t seem to fit the subject though.', '2002-04-22 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50709, 991, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the mood and tone of this photograph.  i think the out of focus background adds to the image.  The only thing I don''t like is that the transitional concept here is a little weak.  Without the title, I would have had a hard time with it.</td>', 'I like the mood and tone of this photograph.  i think the out of focus background adds to the image.  The only thing I don''t like is that the transitional concept here is a little weak.  Without the title, I would have had a hard time with it.', '2002-04-22 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50710, 991, 798, '<td valign="top">Whats the transition?</td>', 'Whats the transition?', '2002-04-22 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50711, 991, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot, excellent perspective.  (Also a big fan of the subject.)</td>', 'Great shot, excellent perspective.  (Also a big fan of the subject.)', '2002-04-22 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50712, 991, 387, '<td valign="top">I like DOF here, nice contrast</td>', 'I like DOF here, nice contrast', '2002-04-22 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50713, 991, 361, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Need more light on the cross.</td>', 'Good subject. Need more light on the cross.', '2002-04-22 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50714, 991, 675, '<td valign="top">good idea, i think it might be hard for some people to understand the transition however</td>', 'good idea, i think it might be hard for some people to understand the transition however', '2002-04-22 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50715, 991, 739, '<td valign="top">Simple, but so beautifully shot.  The small depth of field works wonders for this shot.  Could the cross itself be a bit brighter?</td>', 'Simple, but so beautifully shot.  The small depth of field works wonders for this shot.  Could the cross itself be a bit brighter?', '2002-04-22 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50716, 991, 113, '<td valign="top">You did a very nice job on this.  B&amp;W added  that extra umph.  Surface looks bumpy.</td>', 'You did a very nice job on this.  B&W added  that extra umph.  Surface looks bumpy.', '2002-04-23 05:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50717, 991, 1273, '<td valign="top">nice strong image.</td>', 'nice strong image.', '2002-04-23 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50718, 991, 441, '<td valign="top">nice compelling shot good composition</td>', 'nice compelling shot good composition', '2002-04-23 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50719, 991, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, great use if DOF.</td>', 'Very good composition, great use if DOF.', '2002-04-23 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
