(50952, 1006, 811, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like the dark on dark, it really makes the white stand out, and I really like the effect of the second hand.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like the dark on dark, it really makes the white stand out, and I really like the effect of the second hand.', '2002-04-26 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
