(50954, 1006, 813, '<td valign="top">Cool multiple exposure, wish my camera would do that. Did you try different angles for a more dynamic composition. Perhaps real low near the "5" with a wide angle lens would work to emphasize the hour in transition.</td>', 'Cool multiple exposure, wish my camera would do that. Did you try different angles for a more dynamic composition. Perhaps real low near the "5" with a wide angle lens would work to emphasize the hour in transition.', '2002-04-27 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50955, 1006, 888, '<td valign="top">nice idea, I think it would have worked better if the second hanbd had been captured away from the bigger hands so we could see more of it.  Of course it wouldn''t be on the dot of 5 then would it though.</td>', 'nice idea, I think it would have worked better if the second hanbd had been captured away from the bigger hands so we could see more of it.  Of course it wouldn''t be on the dot of 5 then would it though.', '2002-04-27 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50956, 1006, 869, '<td valign="top">Definitely a site for sore eyes, and a welcome "transition" for most of us!</td>', 'Definitely a site for sore eyes, and a welcome "transition" for most of us!', '2002-04-27 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50957, 1006, 346, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2002-04-28 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50958, 1006, 1017, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  This one got my 10 vote this week!</td>', 'Excellent.  This one got my 10 vote this week!', '2002-04-28 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50959, 1006, 107, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot.. I think it makes it stand out from the others.  The idea is awsome as well.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot.. I think it makes it stand out from the others.  The idea is awsome as well.', '2002-04-28 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50960, 1006, 205, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t get is if this an eight second exposure how''d you get the little hand 9 times?</td>', 'The only thing I don''t get is if this an eight second exposure how''d you get the little hand 9 times?', '2002-04-29 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(50961, 1006, 387, '<td valign="top">There is no way this deserved any ones. You should have been in the top three.</td>', 'There is no way this deserved any ones. You should have been in the top three.', '2002-04-29 05:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(50962, 1006, 772, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments on this photo.  It *is* an 8 second long exposure.  I got 9 ticks of the second hand because I opened the shutter between ticks...  My primary objective with this photo was to see if I could produce something that would not score any ones.  I failed.. lol..  I got very few negative comments this time and I''m very pleased with the results.  I think the primary problem with this shot is that a few did not understand the transition.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments on this photo.  It *is* an 8 second long exposure.  I got 9 ticks of the second hand because I opened the shutter between ticks...  My primary objective with this photo was to see if I could produce something that would not score any ones.  I failed.. lol..  I got very few negative comments this time and I''m very pleased with the results.  I think the primary problem with this shot is that a few did not understand the transition.', '2002-04-29 05:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(50963, 1006, 1, '<td valign="top">This shot definitely deserved a ribbon of some sort.  It was too perfect not to.</td>', 'This shot definitely deserved a ribbon of some sort.  It was too perfect not to.', '2002-04-29 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(50964, 1006, 554, '<td valign="top">This is one we can all learn from. Thanks John!</td>', 'This is one we can all learn from. Thanks John!', '2002-04-29 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(50965, 1008, 441, '<td valign="top">nice shot, original subject</td>', 'nice shot, original subject', '2002-04-23 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50966, 1008, 749, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this transition would have been very hard to work out. Good lighting, and the scene looks natural, not posed.</td>', 'Without the title, this transition would have been very hard to work out. Good lighting, and the scene looks natural, not posed.', '2002-04-25 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(50967, 1008, 1024, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the  dolls makes this photo match the theme very well.</td>', 'The reflection of the  dolls makes this photo match the theme very well.', '2002-04-22 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
