(51384, 1036, 1244, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning photograph.  Maybe I''m dense, but where''s the transition?  I guess it has to hit me over the head in order for me to understand it.</td>', 'This is a stunning photograph.  Maybe I''m dense, but where''s the transition?  I guess it has to hit me over the head in order for me to understand it.', '2002-04-23 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51385, 1036, 1, '<td valign="top">The whole blue cast is not too appealing.  I''m struggling to understand your meaning here too, but I''ll give it a shot.<br/><br/>Trees are crying because this is a picture of a bull dozer and it''s going to transition the land into apart complexes, buildings, etc?  :)</td>', 'The whole blue cast is not too appealing.  I''m struggling to understand your meaning here too, but I''ll give it a shot.Trees are crying because this is a picture of a bull dozer and it''s going to transition the land into apart complexes, buildings, etc?  :)', '2002-04-23 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51386, 1036, 357, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the colourbalance tweak.  Not sure you quite hit your mark though; maybe an actual crushed sapling would get it.</td>', 'Interesting use of the colourbalance tweak.  Not sure you quite hit your mark though; maybe an actual crushed sapling would get it.', '2002-04-23 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
