(51454, 1038, 301, '<td valign="top">Thanx for da comments<br/><br/>Found this in a very small park.  People there must''ve thought I was crazy walking around taking photos of dead flowers.  As I was walking out, this red flower caught my eye (got no idea what the name is)<br/><br/>No it wasn''t Photoshopped - the red flowers go purple when they die.  The only thing I did was move one of the dead flowers (the purple &amp; yellow one underneath the red) away slightly ''cos it was blocking the living one.</td>', 'Thanx for da commentsFound this in a very small park.  People there must''ve thought I was crazy walking around taking photos of dead flowers.  As I was walking out, this red flower caught my eye (got no idea what the name is)No it wasn''t Photoshopped - the red flowers go purple when they die.  The only thing I did was move one of the dead flowers (the purple & yellow one underneath the red) away slightly ''cos it was blocking the living one.', '2002-04-29 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(51455, 1039, 739, '<td valign="top">Right idea, but by not putting the bud in focus, you lost the message of transition.  I can''t help by look at the sunflower as being the subject and everything else as being the background.  The background is adding very little to the message.</td>', 'Right idea, but by not putting the bud in focus, you lost the message of transition.  I can''t help by look at the sunflower as being the subject and everything else as being the background.  The background is adding very little to the message.', '2002-04-22 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
