(51607, 1048, 2, '<td valign="top">Did you try taking this photo at different times of day?  The lighting in this one makes the background seem washed out.</td>', 'Did you try taking this photo at different times of day?  The lighting in this one makes the background seem washed out.', '2002-04-25 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51608, 1048, 142, '<td valign="top">You captured the challenge well.  The background and angle of this photo makes an ordinary subject stand out .  I like how you managed to capture the red and yellow lights.  They match the trees in the background.  Good job.</td>', 'You captured the challenge well.  The background and angle of this photo makes an ordinary subject stand out .  I like how you managed to capture the red and yellow lights.  They match the trees in the background.  Good job.', '2002-04-26 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51609, 1048, 886, '<td valign="top">Wow!.. but where did you find red leaves in April? New Zealand?</td>', 'Wow!.. but where did you find red leaves in April? New Zealand?', '2002-04-26 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51610, 1048, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting light design -- where is it?</td>', 'Interesting light design -- where is it?', '2002-04-26 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51611, 1048, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is the best traffic light pic i''ve seen.  not because of the traffic light, but because of the leaves in the background.  although, that makes me wonder - was this photo actually taken in april?  nonetheless, i gave the photographer the benefit of the doubt and didn''t take off any points.</td>', 'this is the best traffic light pic i''ve seen.  not because of the traffic light, but because of the leaves in the background.  although, that makes me wonder - was this photo actually taken in april?  nonetheless, i gave the photographer the benefit of the doubt and didn''t take off any points.', '2002-04-26 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51612, 1048, 811, '<td valign="top">What I really liked about this picture is how the leaves are all different colors as well.  The background is a bit bright for my taste, though.</td>', 'What I really liked about this picture is how the leaves are all different colors as well.  The background is a bit bright for my taste, though.', '2002-04-27 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51613, 1048, 27, '<td valign="top">Was it part of your plan to catch the leaf changes too?</td>', 'Was it part of your plan to catch the leaf changes too?', '2002-04-27 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51614, 1048, 1070, '<td valign="top">Stop lights are a bit cliche in this challenge, but the change in colours of the leaves in the background add an additional dimension to this picture, although its a shame this picture couldn''t have been taken in the autumn.  (transition of stop light would compliment the transition of seasons nicely.)  I don''t like the excessive lighting in the background on the right.  Perhaps a different time of day would have solved this problem?</td>', 'Stop lights are a bit cliche in this challenge, but the change in colours of the leaves in the background add an additional dimension to this picture, although its a shame this picture couldn''t have been taken in the autumn.  (transition of stop light would compliment the transition of seasons nicely.)  I don''t like the excessive lighting in the background on the right.  Perhaps a different time of day would have solved this problem?', '2002-04-27 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51615, 1048, 869, '<td valign="top">The traffic light seems to be a favorite in the challenge, but having the turning leaves as well as a turning light really emphasizes transition.</td>', 'The traffic light seems to be a favorite in the challenge, but having the turning leaves as well as a turning light really emphasizes transition.', '2002-04-27 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51616, 1048, 245, '<td valign="top">i worry a lot of people are going to completely miss the trees in the background and comment solely on the light. In any case, the sky is a touch blown out, give the whole image a hazy feel, i''d much rather a darker exposure and a crisp, tight feel. the placement of the stop light is kinda bland as well, it doesn''t have much impact.</td>', 'i worry a lot of people are going to completely miss the trees in the background and comment solely on the light. In any case, the sky is a touch blown out, give the whole image a hazy feel, i''d much rather a darker exposure and a crisp, tight feel. the placement of the stop light is kinda bland as well, it doesn''t have much impact.', '2002-04-28 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51617, 1048, 674, '<td valign="top">For the doubters of the april changes of leaves remember in the southern hemisphere such as New Zealand South Africa etc it is Autumn!</td>', 'For the doubters of the april changes of leaves remember in the southern hemisphere such as New Zealand South Africa etc it is Autumn!', '2002-04-29 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(51618, 1048, 1040, '<td valign="top">I live in South Africa and it is Autumn here. So I can tell you that this photo was taken during Autumn which is happening right now.</td>', 'I live in South Africa and it is Autumn here. So I can tell you that this photo was taken during Autumn which is happening right now.', '2002-04-30 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(51619, 1051, 441, '<td valign="top">this image is only 50Kb and it shows - you need to take advantage of the 150Kb allowed</td>', 'this image is only 50Kb and it shows - you need to take advantage of the 150Kb allowed', '2002-04-23 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51620, 1051, 1175, '<td valign="top">That was one of my ideas for transition too.  Didn''t take that picture though.  I don''t like the color, its like a warm sepia or something.  The picture could have been composed better.</td>', 'That was one of my ideas for transition too.  Didn''t take that picture though.  I don''t like the color, its like a warm sepia or something.  The picture could have been composed better.', '2002-04-23 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
