(51632, 1051, 1242, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone lends a nostalgic mood to an already somber photograph. Very effective.</td>', 'The sepia tone lends a nostalgic mood to an already somber photograph. Very effective.', '2002-04-22 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51633, 1051, 675, '<td valign="top">yeah, this is sad, i wish there was a closer more intimate view of what it looked like(not in a morbid way?</td>', 'yeah, this is sad, i wish there was a closer more intimate view of what it looked like(not in a morbid way?', '2002-04-22 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51634, 1051, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your transition idea here.. I also like the sepia toning of this image.  Suggestion:  When shooting a shot like this, don''t shoot straight on... Add some depth to your photo by shooting from an angle.  A little camera tilt here may have also increased the impact of this photo...</td>', 'I like your transition idea here.. I also like the sepia toning of this image.  Suggestion:  When shooting a shot like this, don''t shoot straight on... Add some depth to your photo by shooting from an angle.  A little camera tilt here may have also increased the impact of this photo...', '2002-04-22 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51635, 1051, 156, '<td valign="top">the final transition...</td>', 'the final transition...', '2002-04-23 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51636, 1051, 1, '<td valign="top">The image seems too busy.  A better centering of the tent, and the boquet of flowers centered directly in the center of the centered tent, might''ve resulted in better composition.  :)</td>', 'The image seems too busy.  A better centering of the tent, and the boquet of flowers centered directly in the center of the centered tent, might''ve resulted in better composition.  :)', '2002-04-23 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
