(51645, 1051, 472, '<td valign="top">wow. great picture.  i like the weird sepia tone.  i think it needs a little mores sharpening.</td>', 'wow. great picture.  i like the weird sepia tone.  i think it needs a little mores sharpening.', '2002-04-26 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51646, 1051, 811, '<td valign="top">good shot, wish it was slid a little to the left.</td>', 'good shot, wish it was slid a little to the left.', '2002-04-27 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51647, 1051, 1290, '<td valign="top">The tone and sombreness of this photo depicts the darkness of the hour very well</td>', 'The tone and sombreness of this photo depicts the darkness of the hour very well', '2002-04-27 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51648, 1051, 142, '<td valign="top">I know this is definately a love/hate photo.  In answer to some of the comments, the reason I did not have mourners inthe photo is because it then becomes "someone''s" funeral.  I wanted to convey that this could be "anyone''s" funeral.  Besides, taking photos of actual mourners goes against my morals.  That is too sacred an event to intrude upon.  <br/><br/>The reason for the angle is to convey a straight on in your face impact.  I had other angles and perspectives but they seemed too soft to me.  <br/><br/>Thanks for the comments on the sepia tone and the focus.  I wish this were sharper too and that is the one thing I would have changed.  <br/></td>', 'I know this is definately a love/hate photo.  In answer to some of the comments, the reason I did not have mourners inthe photo is because it then becomes "someone''s" funeral.  I wanted to convey that this could be "anyone''s" funeral.  Besides, taking photos of actual mourners goes against my morals.  That is too sacred an event to intrude upon.  The reason for the angle is to convey a straight on in your face impact.  I had other angles and perspectives but they seemed too soft to me.  Thanks for the comments on the sepia tone and the focus.  I wish this were sharper too and that is the one thing I would have changed.  ', '2002-04-29 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(51649, 1051, 245, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, the color is perfect for the scene, and the blown out sky works really well, as if the, um, awning? tent? is a gate to a bright white beyond. The complete lack of people adds a bit of desolation to the scene, too... it''s unsettling.</td>', 'I really like this photo, the color is perfect for the scene, and the blown out sky works really well, as if the, um, awning? tent? is a gate to a bright white beyond. The complete lack of people adds a bit of desolation to the scene, too... it''s unsettling.', '2002-05-02 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(51650, 1052, 739, '<td valign="top">Transition, at least for me, implies motion and a sense of being temporary.  I don''t see that in this picture.  It''s a good contrast between new and old, but nothing transitory about it.</td>', 'Transition, at least for me, implies motion and a sense of being temporary.  I don''t see that in this picture.  It''s a good contrast between new and old, but nothing transitory about it.', '2002-04-22 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51651, 1052, 1244, '<td valign="top">Interesting... before and after in the same building.</td>', 'Interesting... before and after in the same building.', '2002-04-23 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51652, 1052, 441, '<td valign="top">good subject</td>', 'good subject', '2002-04-23 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51653, 1052, 933, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting in which to capture this shot.  I like the use of black and white.</td>', 'Tough lighting in which to capture this shot.  I like the use of black and white.', '2002-04-25 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51654, 1052, 1024, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast between the bright white and the deep shadows is to harsh.  Loved the subject though.</td>', 'I think the contrast between the bright white and the deep shadows is to harsh.  Loved the subject though.', '2002-04-22 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51655, 1052, 138, '<td valign="top">hmm, not bad, not bad</td>', 'hmm, not bad, not bad', '2002-04-22 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51656, 1052, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting, light to dark and old to new for the windows.  Exposure is a bit blown out on the light side - though it would be hard to get balanced.    Overall not really sharp enough to have much bite.  Good attempt.</td>', 'Interesting, light to dark and old to new for the windows.  Exposure is a bit blown out on the light side - though it would be hard to get balanced.    Overall not really sharp enough to have much bite.  Good attempt.', '2002-04-22 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51657, 1052, 878, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2002-04-22 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51658, 1052, 641, '<td valign="top">cool catch.. contrast is high on the left side, but it works in this shot.</td>', 'cool catch.. contrast is high on the left side, but it works in this shot.', '2002-04-22 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51659, 1052, 189, '<td valign="top">Love it! Could have been a little more square though.</td>', 'Love it! Could have been a little more square though.', '2002-04-22 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51660, 1052, 798, '<td valign="top">two seperate windows? Where''s the transition?</td>', 'two seperate windows? Where''s the transition?', '2002-04-22 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
