(51662, 1052, 675, '<td valign="top">hmm, i would have liked it better if the old was on the left</td>', 'hmm, i would have liked it better if the old was on the left', '2002-04-22 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51663, 1052, 156, '<td valign="top">interesting, i like that you captured the new window with the light on it''s side, further emphasizes the transition from old (''n dreary) to new (''n bright)</td>', 'interesting, i like that you captured the new window with the light on it''s side, further emphasizes the transition from old (''n dreary) to new (''n bright)', '2002-04-23 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51664, 1052, 715, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. You did very well by choosing to do this iin B&amp;W.</td>', 'Excellent photo. You did very well by choosing to do this iin B&W.', '2002-04-23 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51665, 1052, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of dark and light.  I wish the image was clear though... It seems a little grainy.</td>', 'Nice contrast of dark and light.  I wish the image was clear though... It seems a little grainy.', '2002-04-23 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51666, 1052, 357, '<td valign="top">I guess what you''re getting at is that the window on the left is newer than the right.  The problem is that your dynamic range is too much for the camera so the left window is over exposed and the right one is underexposed.  You could use a half neutral-density filter to reduce the contrast between the two, and get good exposure on both.  Alternatively, you could add more lighting, or wait until the sun is in a better place.</td>', 'I guess what you''re getting at is that the window on the left is newer than the right.  The problem is that your dynamic range is too much for the camera so the left window is over exposed and the right one is underexposed.  You could use a half neutral-density filter to reduce the contrast between the two, and get good exposure on both.  Alternatively, you could add more lighting, or wait until the sun is in a better place.', '2002-04-23 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51667, 1052, 352, '<td valign="top">Holy overxposed!  This is a very interesting shot/subject, but the hotness of the left side distracts much too much.</td>', 'Holy overxposed!  This is a very interesting shot/subject, but the hotness of the left side distracts much too much.', '2002-04-23 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51668, 1052, 509, '<td valign="top">Transition from light to dark works well here, good use of black and white.  I would have liked it better if the left side wasn''t so bright though</td>', 'Transition from light to dark works well here, good use of black and white.  I would have liked it better if the left side wasn''t so bright though', '2002-04-23 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51669, 1052, 1209, '<td valign="top">Nice study in contrasts (of all kinds).</td>', 'Nice study in contrasts (of all kinds).', '2002-04-24 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51670, 1052, 142, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.</td>', 'Good contrast.', '2002-04-24 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51671, 1052, 245, '<td valign="top">the left of the building is very blown out, i wonder if you could have taken a darker exposure and pushed the blacks a bit to bring out the detail of the darker side.</td>', 'the left of the building is very blown out, i wonder if you could have taken a darker exposure and pushed the blacks a bit to bring out the detail of the darker side.', '2002-04-24 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(51672, 1052, 346, '<td valign="top">really nice shot, but its just every so slightly out of focus.</td>', 'really nice shot, but its just every so slightly out of focus.', '2002-04-25 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
