(51706, 1054, 1122, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.<br/>Could you tell me is it featuring rebirth?<br/>It looks like the point of view of a "Corpse"<br/>climbing up from his grave.</td>', 'I like this photo.Could you tell me is it featuring rebirth?It looks like the point of view of a "Corpse"climbing up from his grave.', '2002-04-24 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
