(51771, 1057, 749, '<td valign="top">The high compression on this is very noticable - only 48k of the possible 150k. The lighting is a bit dark, but great idea.</td>', 'The high compression on this is very noticable - only 48k of the possible 150k. The lighting is a bit dark, but great idea.', '2002-04-25 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
