(52070, 1109, 1024, '<td valign="top">I had several comments regarding the fact that I did not include any text on the tombstone.  I was trying for the reflection more, which is why I chose the back side of the granite marker.  I appreciate all of the positive comments and I learned alot from submitting this photograph.</td>', 'I had several comments regarding the fact that I did not include any text on the tombstone.  I was trying for the reflection more, which is why I chose the back side of the granite marker.  I appreciate all of the positive comments and I learned alot from submitting this photograph.', '2002-04-29 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
