(52076, 1111, 656, '<td valign="top">very interesting mixed message.  I always associate closure with the end of a relationship... is that the meaning ?  The rings seem to imply togetherness though.  The person leaving and closing the door implies and end to the relationship, as if the rings were left as they were on the way out...  Nicely lit to keep the foreground in detail but the background as shadows.  Would have liked the rings to be closer/ larger though.<br/><br/>Great attempt.  Would like to understand the message more when we find out who took it though :)</td>', 'very interesting mixed message.  I always associate closure with the end of a relationship... is that the meaning ?  The rings seem to imply togetherness though.  The person leaving and closing the door implies and end to the relationship, as if the rings were left as they were on the way out...  Nicely lit to keep the foreground in detail but the background as shadows.  Would have liked the rings to be closer/ larger though.Great attempt.  Would like to understand the message more when we find out who took it though :)', '2002-04-22 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52077, 1111, 142, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and well done.  This seems to tell a story that is open to interpretation.  I love it.</td>', 'Very artistic and well done.  This seems to tell a story that is open to interpretation.  I love it.', '2002-04-22 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
