(52593, 1127, 813, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a very strong image with cropping. The kid in the foreground has an innocent look about him and too me the pipe being offered suggests that is about to change hence fitting the challenge beautifully. Try taking off the left and top quarters of the photo and see what happens.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a very strong image with cropping. The kid in the foreground has an innocent look about him and too me the pipe being offered suggests that is about to change hence fitting the challenge beautifully. Try taking off the left and top quarters of the photo and see what happens.', '2002-04-27 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
