(52599, 1129, 441, '<td valign="top">image has suffered because you have compressed it down to 75Kb - you need to use as much of the permissable 150Kb as possible - if you are unsure how to do this post a question in the challenge</td>', 'image has suffered because you have compressed it down to 75Kb - you need to use as much of the permissable 150Kb as possible - if you are unsure how to do this post a question in the challenge', '2002-04-23 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
