(52930, 1140, 641, '<td valign="top">GReat shot!! how on earth did you get that fade out purple behind the table? Please tell.</td>', 'GReat shot!! how on earth did you get that fade out purple behind the table? Please tell.', '2002-04-22 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
