(52932, 1140, 933, '<td valign="top">A nice photo.  Could be in a wine brochure!  Seems a tad out of focus and the shadows are a bit distracting.</td>', 'A nice photo.  Could be in a wine brochure!  Seems a tad out of focus and the shadows are a bit distracting.', '2002-04-22 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52933, 1140, 327, '<td valign="top">good idea, good shot, good work.</td>', 'good idea, good shot, good work.', '2002-04-22 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52934, 1140, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the white background, and how the glasses are on the opposite sides from their bottles and respective grapes.</td>', 'i like the white background, and how the glasses are on the opposite sides from their bottles and respective grapes.', '2002-04-22 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52935, 1140, 117, '<td valign="top">i''ll drink to that</td>', 'i''ll drink to that', '2002-04-22 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52936, 1140, 428, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, great composition and focusing, I like the light reflections on the purple grapes, but the reflection on the wine bottles is a little distracting</td>', 'very nice shot, great composition and focusing, I like the light reflections on the purple grapes, but the reflection on the wine bottles is a little distracting', '2002-04-22 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52937, 1140, 675, '<td valign="top">good photography skills, not an interesting transition in my opinion</td>', 'good photography skills, not an interesting transition in my opinion', '2002-04-22 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52938, 1140, 965, '<td valign="top">I really liked this idea, but the glasses aren''t lined up the same on either side, and the grapes are also not balanced. This was the difference between a good picture and a great picture for me; it just needed to be a bit more symmetrical.</td>', 'I really liked this idea, but the glasses aren''t lined up the same on either side, and the grapes are also not balanced. This was the difference between a good picture and a great picture for me; it just needed to be a bit more symmetrical.', '2002-04-23 04:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52939, 1140, 156, '<td valign="top">aside from the prettiness (love the lighting, the colors and the lines of the bottles), the transition is obvious, good job!</td>', 'aside from the prettiness (love the lighting, the colors and the lines of the bottles), the transition is obvious, good job!', '2002-04-23 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52940, 1140, 1191, '<td valign="top">A nice still life, well executed.</td>', 'A nice still life, well executed.', '2002-04-23 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52941, 1140, 357, '<td valign="top">I think the transitional nature of the subject requires that any winemaking related pictures should be of grapes squashing through people''s toes.  This picture almost gets the commercial look, but the light reflecting of the bottles is too hard, and it is almost over exposed.  More problematically though, it isn''t very interestingly composed.</td>', 'I think the transitional nature of the subject requires that any winemaking related pictures should be of grapes squashing through people''s toes.  This picture almost gets the commercial look, but the light reflecting of the bottles is too hard, and it is almost over exposed.  More problematically though, it isn''t very interestingly composed.', '2002-04-23 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52942, 1140, 352, '<td valign="top">Nice jusxtaposition of glass vs type crossing the picture.  This would have been excellnet for the upcoming product challenge as well.  How''d you achieve the totally white background?</td>', 'Nice jusxtaposition of glass vs type crossing the picture.  This would have been excellnet for the upcoming product challenge as well.  How''d you achieve the totally white background?', '2002-04-23 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52943, 1140, 1175, '<td valign="top">Did you steal this from a magazine?  Just kidding.  Very nice picture.</td>', 'Did you steal this from a magazine?  Just kidding.  Very nice picture.', '2002-04-23 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52944, 1140, 674, '<td valign="top">looks like a professional advertising shot.</td>', 'looks like a professional advertising shot.', '2002-04-24 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52945, 1140, 436, '<td valign="top">great shot for an ad</td>', 'great shot for an ad', '2002-04-24 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52946, 1140, 748, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots.  Looks like it belongs in a magazine someplace!</td>', 'One of my favorite shots.  Looks like it belongs in a magazine someplace!', '2002-04-24 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52947, 1140, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Very crisp.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Very crisp.', '2002-04-24 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52948, 1140, 918, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.</td>', 'Nicely composed.', '2002-04-25 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52949, 1140, 142, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done photo.</td>', 'Beautifully done photo.', '2002-04-25 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52950, 1140, 527, '<td valign="top">Nice still shot. I like the symmetry andthe fact that the glasses are switched from their corresponding bottles.</td>', 'Nice still shot. I like the symmetry andthe fact that the glasses are switched from their corresponding bottles.', '2002-04-26 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52951, 1140, 346, '<td valign="top">nice ying/yang concept for this still life.</td>', 'nice ying/yang concept for this still life.', '2002-04-27 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52952, 1140, 1070, '<td valign="top">Well taken, but this is better suited for a contrast than a transition.</td>', 'Well taken, but this is better suited for a contrast than a transition.', '2002-04-27 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52953, 1140, 811, '<td valign="top">I do not drink alcohol of any kind, but this is probably my favorite picture.  I like the symmetry and balance you''ve set up.  the lighteningis good, and everything is very much in focus.  One tiny little thing -- maybe scoot the red glass right a bit, or the white one left.  Still -- great shot.  10.</td>', 'I do not drink alcohol of any kind, but this is probably my favorite picture.  I like the symmetry and balance you''ve set up.  the lighteningis good, and everything is very much in focus.  One tiny little thing -- maybe scoot the red glass right a bit, or the white one left.  Still -- great shot.  10.', '2002-04-27 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52954, 1140, 888, '<td valign="top">hmmmm alcohol<br/>Really good</td>', 'hmmmm alcoholReally good', '2002-04-28 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52955, 1140, 449, '<td valign="top">do you work for Riunite, or what? where is the cheese with this wine...oh there it is, its your picture!</td>', 'do you work for Riunite, or what? where is the cheese with this wine...oh there it is, its your picture!', '2002-04-28 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52956, 1140, 245, '<td valign="top">there are some serious aliasing artifacts around the edges of the wine glasses, how did you convert this image to it''s final size? also, i don''t know enough about wine to tell if those are good wines or not. :)</td>', 'there are some serious aliasing artifacts around the edges of the wine glasses, how did you convert this image to it''s final size? also, i don''t know enough about wine to tell if those are good wines or not. :)', '2002-04-28 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52957, 1140, 637, '<td valign="top">Great commercial graphic.</td>', 'Great commercial graphic.', '2002-04-28 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52958, 1140, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo...might try to duplicate it myself...if you don''t mind<br/>Grayce</td>', 'I think this is a great photo...might try to duplicate it myself...if you don''t mindGrayce', '2002-07-22 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(52959, 1141, 739, '<td valign="top">One of the better subjects in this whole contest.  The picture is kinda grainy.  Is that intentional? Did you try different camera angles or try this same shot during different times of the day to give the hands slightly more interesting shadows? The lack of shadows suggest that this shot was taken at noon.</td>', 'One of the better subjects in this whole contest.  The picture is kinda grainy.  Is that intentional? Did you try different camera angles or try this same shot during different times of the day to give the hands slightly more interesting shadows? The lack of shadows suggest that this shot was taken at noon.', '2002-04-22 02:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52960, 1141, 749, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and lots of texture visible.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and lots of texture visible.', '2002-04-25 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52961, 1141, 570, '<td valign="top">look at me, I think this actually means something</td>', 'look at me, I think this actually means something', '2002-04-25 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52962, 1141, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the gravestone isn''t centered and is a little crooked.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the gravestone isn''t centered and is a little crooked.', '2002-04-22 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52963, 1141, 138, '<td valign="top">very good idea, black and white makes it</td>', 'very good idea, black and white makes it', '2002-04-22 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52964, 1141, 714, '<td valign="top">Great photo and idea.</td>', 'Great photo and idea.', '2002-04-22 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
