(52966, 1141, 656, '<td valign="top">morbid interpretation of the wedding vows :)  B&amp;W works well for this.  good entry.</td>', 'morbid interpretation of the wedding vows :)  B&W works well for this.  good entry.', '2002-04-22 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52967, 1141, 142, '<td valign="top">I love the symbolism of your photo.  The background is also attractive and well focused.</td>', 'I love the symbolism of your photo.  The background is also attractive and well focused.', '2002-04-22 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52968, 1141, 933, '<td valign="top">Very strong photo!  B&amp;W works well here.</td>', 'Very strong photo!  B&W works well here.', '2002-04-22 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52969, 1141, 1258, '<td valign="top">What a neat photo!!!</td>', 'What a neat photo!!!', '2002-04-22 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52970, 1141, 889, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept does your camera shoot B&amp;W or was it converted later in a photo program?</td>', 'Interesting concept does your camera shoot B&W or was it converted later in a photo program?', '2002-04-22 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52971, 1141, 798, '<td valign="top">Morbid &amp; dont marry a leper</td>', 'Morbid & dont marry a leper', '2002-04-22 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52972, 1141, 1066, '<td valign="top">At first the image disturbed me a bit for some reason.  The mariage ring and headstone are a perfect match and I like the great depth of field here.  Probably my favorite image here and wouldn''t mind if you could provide for a larger high eefinition version for my files.</td>', 'At first the image disturbed me a bit for some reason.  The mariage ring and headstone are a perfect match and I like the great depth of field here.  Probably my favorite image here and wouldn''t mind if you could provide for a larger high eefinition version for my files.', '2002-04-22 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52973, 1141, 327, '<td valign="top">humm, creepy, real, nice shot and like the b&amp;w.</td>', 'humm, creepy, real, nice shot and like the b&w.', '2002-04-22 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52974, 1141, 675, '<td valign="top">I really get what is trying to be said here...This is obviously a couple of men''s hands...In a cemetary...This is great stuff and great irony...Hopefully this will signal the end of gay wedding proposals in cemetaries</td>', 'I really get what is trying to be said here...This is obviously a couple of men''s hands...In a cemetary...This is great stuff and great irony...Hopefully this will signal the end of gay wedding proposals in cemetaries', '2002-04-22 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52975, 1141, 203, '<td valign="top">Where is the white in this Black &amp; gray?</td>', 'Where is the white in this Black & gray?', '2002-04-22 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52976, 1141, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo makes me think... I''m divorced... :(  but it had nothing to do with photograph ;)  I also love black and whites and your ''tranistion'' concept here is getting you a good score.  Only suggestion I could make is to straighten up the stone in the frame a little... nice job!</td>', 'This photo makes me think... I''m divorced... :(  but it had nothing to do with photograph ;)  I also love black and whites and your ''tranistion'' concept here is getting you a good score.  Only suggestion I could make is to straighten up the stone in the frame a little... nice job!', '2002-04-22 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1);
