(52982, 1141, 1191, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and a nice shot to boot.</td>', 'Great idea, and a nice shot to boot.', '2002-04-23 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52983, 1141, 352, '<td valign="top">Eerie.  Would a softer foucs on the hands improve this?  I''m not sure...</td>', 'Eerie.  Would a softer foucs on the hands improve this?  I''m not sure...', '2002-04-23 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52984, 1141, 346, '<td valign="top">beautiful crisp shot. Great contrast, great composition.</td>', 'beautiful crisp shot. Great contrast, great composition.', '2002-04-23 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52985, 1141, 1175, '<td valign="top">Good symbolism.</td>', 'Good symbolism.', '2002-04-23 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52986, 1141, 428, '<td valign="top">good idea. The tombstone is leaning just a bit, b&amp;w is good for this shot</td>', 'good idea. The tombstone is leaning just a bit, b&w is good for this shot', '2002-04-24 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52987, 1141, 527, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I really like this one. The black and white is very effective. What if the background was blurred a little bit so you could still tell there are tombstones back there. It might make the foreground stand out even more.</td>', 'Yeah, I really like this one. The black and white is very effective. What if the background was blurred a little bit so you could still tell there are tombstones back there. It might make the foreground stand out even more.', '2002-04-26 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52988, 1141, 472, '<td valign="top">hm. i can tfigure out if this pic is pro or anti marriage ; ) .. it seems to be anti.  underscoring theonly way of breaking the bonf being death.  creative pic!</td>', 'hm. i can tfigure out if this pic is pro or anti marriage ; ) .. it seems to be anti.  underscoring theonly way of breaking the bonf being death.  creative pic!', '2002-04-26 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52989, 1141, 811, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  the black n white really sets an atmosphere here.</td>', 'nice shot.  the black n white really sets an atmosphere here.', '2002-04-27 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52990, 1141, 1070, '<td valign="top">The guys hand isn''t the most beautiful hand I''ve ever seen....</td>', 'The guys hand isn''t the most beautiful hand I''ve ever seen....', '2002-04-27 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52991, 1141, 869, '<td valign="top">Powerful image...is this the promise being made, or broken?</td>', 'Powerful image...is this the promise being made, or broken?', '2002-04-27 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52992, 1141, 888, '<td valign="top">depressing but very well taken</td>', 'depressing but very well taken', '2002-04-28 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52993, 1141, 245, '<td valign="top">if only the gravestone weren''t tilted to the left!</td>', 'if only the gravestone weren''t tilted to the left!', '2002-04-28 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52994, 1141, 1066, '<td valign="top">I see the comments about eh headstone angle but remember guys, the background is at the correct angle (trees, ground etc ) which told me that the headstone was naturally angled which added to the interest of the shot.<br/><br/>Easily the most thought provoking shot here and my favorite.  Can you make a hi rez image available?</td>', 'I see the comments about eh headstone angle but remember guys, the background is at the correct angle (trees, ground etc ) which told me that the headstone was naturally angled which added to the interest of the shot.Easily the most thought provoking shot here and my favorite.  Can you make a hi rez image available?', '2002-04-29 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(52995, 1141, 675, '<td valign="top">just so people know, i am not a leper</td>', 'just so people know, i am not a leper', '2002-04-29 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(52996, 1141, 259, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  As hokie said the gravestone iteself is angled.  Maybe I should have chosen a different stone, but oh well.  But in general I made people think, and thats better than making people feel warm and fuzzy on the inside, like most people''s pictures here try to do.  So it was a success.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  As hokie said the gravestone iteself is angled.  Maybe I should have chosen a different stone, but oh well.  But in general I made people think, and thats better than making people feel warm and fuzzy on the inside, like most people''s pictures here try to do.  So it was a success.', '2002-04-30 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(52997, 1142, 749, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped tighter on the lower centre of the shot, where the most crossovers are, plus this would help hide that the shot was taken on the move (eg the banding in the lower right).</td>', 'I would have cropped tighter on the lower centre of the shot, where the most crossovers are, plus this would help hide that the shot was taken on the move (eg the banding in the lower right).', '2002-04-25 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52998, 1142, 1054, '<td valign="top">I tried to do this theme myself but couldn''t make it work with my camera!  Thank goodness I''m getting a new one.  Great shot!</td>', 'I tried to do this theme myself but couldn''t make it work with my camera!  Thank goodness I''m getting a new one.  Great shot!', '2002-04-22 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(52999, 1142, 1, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re looking out a window.  The glare doesn''t do much for the image.</td>', 'Looks like you''re looking out a window.  The glare doesn''t do much for the image.', '2002-04-22 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53000, 1142, 804, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of Transitions, but bad reflections from car window.</td>', 'Good interpretation of Transitions, but bad reflections from car window.', '2002-04-22 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53001, 1142, 656, '<td valign="top">good framing but a not very exciting shot.  Get the transition point.   Shot from a car ?  The reflections are annoying.</td>', 'good framing but a not very exciting shot.  Get the transition point.   Shot from a car ?  The reflections are annoying.', '2002-04-22 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53002, 1142, 509, '<td valign="top">Your windshield''s dirty = P</td>', 'Your windshield''s dirty = P', '2002-04-22 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53003, 1142, 1041, '<td valign="top">Which way to go - help!  I think a slightly lower angle would''ve helped, it would''ve created less sky and put more of the maze that''s almost lost at the bottom of the picture into focus.</td>', 'Which way to go - help!  I think a slightly lower angle would''ve helped, it would''ve created less sky and put more of the maze that''s almost lost at the bottom of the picture into focus.', '2002-04-22 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53004, 1142, 889, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing a shot like this but I dint think about doing it from below.</td>', 'I thought about doing a shot like this but I dint think about doing it from below.', '2002-04-22 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53005, 1142, 641, '<td valign="top">good angle, not too sure about the contrast though</td>', 'good angle, not too sure about the contrast though', '2002-04-22 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53006, 1142, 1175, '<td valign="top">Is that through the window of your car?  I can see some glare in this image.  Would have been cooler if you could actually have stopped somewhere and gotten closer to fill the image with highways.</td>', 'Is that through the window of your car?  I can see some glare in this image.  Would have been cooler if you could actually have stopped somewhere and gotten closer to fill the image with highways.', '2002-04-22 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
