(53009, 1142, 1034, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a good idea.... but perhaps a higher up shot would''ve been a little better.  just my opinion.</td>', 'I think it''s a good idea.... but perhaps a higher up shot would''ve been a little better.  just my opinion.', '2002-04-22 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
