(53023, 1142, 813, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to get a really good picture from a moving car and this one is somewhat spoiled by the reflections in the windshield. I like the off kilter horizon, it creates imbalance. The composition could be improved simply by cropping the top 53 pixels off to fit the 427 x 640 catagory. The result of that would be to draw the eye into look at the intersecting ramps.</td>', 'It is difficult to get a really good picture from a moving car and this one is somewhat spoiled by the reflections in the windshield. I like the off kilter horizon, it creates imbalance. The composition could be improved simply by cropping the top 53 pixels off to fit the 427 x 640 catagory. The result of that would be to draw the eye into look at the intersecting ramps.', '2002-04-27 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53024, 1142, 811, '<td valign="top">excellent shot -- only glitch is the windshield (?) reflection</td>', 'excellent shot -- only glitch is the windshield (?) reflection', '2002-04-27 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53025, 1142, 1070, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, but if you''re going to take time to enter this competition, at least take the time to either get out of the car, or alternatively, just roll down the window.  The reflection ruins the shot.  Could have been framed better too.</td>', 'Good Idea, but if you''re going to take time to enter this competition, at least take the time to either get out of the car, or alternatively, just roll down the window.  The reflection ruins the shot.  Could have been framed better too.', '2002-04-27 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53026, 1142, 346, '<td valign="top">the reflection from the windshield keeps distracting me. It also seems to be tilted a bit.</td>', 'the reflection from the windshield keeps distracting me. It also seems to be tilted a bit.', '2002-04-28 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53027, 1142, 245, '<td valign="top">i think this would work a lot better if the camera didn''t feel tilted to the left and you caught more of the ground below the overpasses. it''s a great angle on this interchange, though!</td>', 'i think this would work a lot better if the camera didn''t feel tilted to the left and you caught more of the ground below the overpasses. it''s a great angle on this interchange, though!', '2002-04-28 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
