(53132, 1146, 357, '<td valign="top">I think this is let down by being underexposed and having an over-yellow colour balance.  I think a white background might have suited the subject better.  Also the droplets look a little over-contrived; I think it would have been better to try and make it more natural.</td>', 'I think this is let down by being underexposed and having an over-yellow colour balance.  I think a white background might have suited the subject better.  Also the droplets look a little over-contrived; I think it would have been better to try and make it more natural.', '2002-04-23 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
