(53134, 1146, 1269, '<td valign="top">You could get a job with singular wireless with a blob like that one.  Nice color contrast.</td>', 'You could get a job with singular wireless with a blob like that one.  Nice color contrast.', '2002-04-24 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
