(53172, 1147, 811, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  It causes the viewer to take a second look.  The dark in the foreground really contrasts nicely with the grey of the cityscape, and I like the way the ferry opening forms a "natural" frame for the picture.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  It causes the viewer to take a second look.  The dark in the foreground really contrasts nicely with the grey of the cityscape, and I like the way the ferry opening forms a "natural" frame for the picture.', '2002-04-27 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
