(53175, 1147, 1066, '<td valign="top">Once again, I really like this photo.  I agree with one comment about the sky.  If in photoshop you could get a bit more contrast in it I think it could help the picture immensely.<br/><br/>I can see the definition is there in the sky waiting to get out but I understand that for this site its hard to get all the elements to balance out becasue of being limited to no layers to seperate the various levels.  Still great photo :-)</td>', 'Once again, I really like this photo.  I agree with one comment about the sky.  If in photoshop you could get a bit more contrast in it I think it could help the picture immensely.I can see the definition is there in the sky waiting to get out but I understand that for this site its hard to get all the elements to balance out becasue of being limited to no layers to seperate the various levels.  Still great photo :-)', '2002-04-29 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
