(53473, 1161, 641, '<td valign="top">Personally I think maybe if the board was pushed up a little more so that the blue checker showed on the lower half and the book was out of view it stand out more.</td>', 'Personally I think maybe if the board was pushed up a little more so that the blue checker showed on the lower half and the book was out of view it stand out more.', '2002-04-22 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
