(53492, 1162, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice.  the wires are horrible though, even though it looks like you''ve tried to frame them and compose them to add something.  The wood pylon behind is also distracting.  Great idea, but I think you should have tried a different set of lights.</td>', 'Nice.  the wires are horrible though, even though it looks like you''ve tried to frame them and compose them to add something.  The wood pylon behind is also distracting.  Great idea, but I think you should have tried a different set of lights.', '2002-04-22 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53493, 1162, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like this traffic light picture over the others as the light fills the frame and is framed by nice leading lines.  The overall framing works well.</td>', 'I like this traffic light picture over the others as the light fills the frame and is framed by nice leading lines.  The overall framing works well.', '2002-04-22 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
