(53509, 1162, 428, '<td valign="top">Your idea was a good one. I''m sure there are many who will criticise the wires, but actually the way they are, I think they give good framing to your subject. The only thing I would change is the brown pole on the left hand side, crop it out and see what you think.</td>', 'Your idea was a good one. I''m sure there are many who will criticise the wires, but actually the way they are, I think they give good framing to your subject. The only thing I would change is the brown pole on the left hand side, crop it out and see what you think.', '2002-04-24 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53510, 1162, 1078, '<td valign="top">I dig the way the lines help frame the photo, but I''m a little distracted by the telephone pole on the left -- cropping a little from the bottom and a little from the left would have cropped it out and left everything in proportion and in the same relative positions</td>', 'I dig the way the lines help frame the photo, but I''m a little distracted by the telephone pole on the left -- cropping a little from the bottom and a little from the left would have cropped it out and left everything in proportion and in the same relative positions', '2002-04-25 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
