(53742, 1171, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice transistion line between the buildings.  Composition could have been stronger: some ideas - 2 thirds one building, 1 third the other. Or maybe the transistion line set up as a diagonal line across the frame - this just seems a bit haphazard or random as it is.</td>', 'Nice transistion line between the buildings.  Composition could have been stronger: some ideas - 2 thirds one building, 1 third the other. Or maybe the transistion line set up as a diagonal line across the frame - this just seems a bit haphazard or random as it is.', '2002-04-22 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
